# Reserva Salvaje, area 4 (C5b, contract 48), 28 x 22. column = i, row = j. Area 3's north edge arrives at the SOUTH edge (spawn `south` (13,20); the south edge (12..14,21) leads back). The deepest area: DENSE ACACIAS and a pond,
# the SECRET HOUSE (a cottage, door (14,4) -> casa_secreta: the Hidrodeslizador, Surf) in the north. Its wild grass is the best of the Reserva (more Lambalm, the strong ones).
@map reserva_4
@size 28 22
@interior no
@area reserva
@bg 0
@fill sav
@spawn south 13 20 N
@spawn secret_door 14 5 S
@encounters grass rate=30
  lambalm 25 27 10
  wombamma 28 31 5   # C9 (contract 56): weight lowered to make room for the fill-in (the table still adds up to 100)
  razorfly 28 31 15   # C9 (contract 56): weight lowered to make room for the fill-in (the table still adds up to 100)
  gnucharge 28 31 10   # C9 (contract 56): weight lowered to make room for the fill-in (the table still adds up to 100)
  quillord 28 30 10   # C9 (contract 56): weight lowered to make room for the fill-in (the table still adds up to 100)
  ferncairn 28 30 15
  dewlash 28 30 10
  lanternmoth 28 30 5
  pinecub 28 31 10   # C9 (contract 56): the fill-in of the design notes
  dashkip 28 31 10   # C9 (contract 56): the fill-in of the design notes
@end
# Open ground (contract 63, wild zone): a step onto plain ground (not tall grass, water, a door, a ledge, an arrow floor) rolls this table when rand8 < 8 (8/256 per step).
@open_rate 8
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 3 creatures of this table wander the open ground (not the tall grass); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 3 table=grass period=1800
@encounters water rate=15
  lazatee 26 30 40
  skipgoby 26 30 30
  gobyhop 28 30 20
  flopfin 25 28 10
@end
@encounters fish_old
  flopfin 5 5 100
@end
@encounters fish_good rate=128
  flopfin 10 10 25
  skipgoby 10 10 30
  lazatee 10 10 25
  clubrimp 10 10 20
@end
@encounters fish_super
  lazatee 18 25 20
  skipgoby 18 25 20
  clubrimp 18 22 10
  reefling 18 25 25
  flopfin 18 22 25
@end
@legend
  .  tile=sav
  g  tile=dgrass
  a  tile=sav object=acacia_0
  b  tile=sav object=acacia_1
  f  tile=sav object=rfence_i
  F  tile=sav object=rfence_j
  W  tile=canal_o
  T  tile=canal_tr
  r  tile=sav object=rock
  y  tile=sav object=dry_bush
  Y  tile=sav object=dry_bush interact=look script=find_res   # D1 (contract 68): the dry bush that hides the sixth Origin Fragment
  n  tile=sav
  h  object=cottage
  d  door=cottage
  s  tile=sav object=sign text=rv.sign4 interact=look
  i  item=prime_salve
  j  item=vit_def
  c  tile=sav item=life_blaze
@grid
  ffffffffffffffffffffffffffff
  Fc.........................F
  F..........................F
  F.ggggggb....hh...Y.b.....bF
  F.gggggg.....hd.......i....F
  F.gggggg.........a.........F
  F.gggggg...b...........b...F
  F..........................F
  Fb..a.....y.....ggggggggg..F
  F.............b.ggggggggg..F
  F..TTTTTTT......ggggggggg..F
  F..WWWWWWW.a....ggggggggga.F
  F..WWWWWWW..a...ggggggggg..F
  F..WWWWWWW.................F
  F..WWWWWWW......a..........F
  F..WWWWWWWgggggggg...a.....F
  F.........gggggggg.........F
  F....j....gggggggg.........F
  F.a...a...ggggsggg.........F
  F..................a....b..F
  F..........................F
  ffffffffffffnnnfffffffffffff
@warp n -> reserva_3 spawn=north
@warp d -> casa_secreta spawn=door
# D1 (contract 68): the sixth Origin Fragment: under a dry bush near the secret house, deep in the Reserva Salvaje.
@script find_res interact
    jf frag_6 empty
    say d1.bush.look
    give_item origin_shard 1
    jv 0 0 full
    setf frag_6
    sfx item
    say gl.d1.got
    end
  full:
    say gl.found.full
    end
  empty:
    say d1.bush.empty
@end
